        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Design intent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Clause is the semantic center of the canonical model. ADR 0050 adds an optional multi-dimensional StructuralProfile. ADR 0051 removes the former flat SemanticRole model; SemanticClassification is the only semantic classification API." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
